{"name": "Little Sheep Valley \u2013 Cozy ranch-builder", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tend to a flock of sheep and create your perfect Mediterranean farm in this cozy ranch-building game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Care for your sheep\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075740/extras/de65d29a246812c0312370dbf19bab0a.webp?t=1786225826\" width=\"600\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075740/extras/142b03933342a2b66801a875e63c265f.poster.avif?t=1786225826\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075740/extras/142b03933342a2b66801a875e63c265f.webm?t=1786225826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075740/extras/142b03933342a2b66801a875e63c265f.mp4?t=1786225826\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Happy sheep = happy you! Live with your sheep on the ranch and take care of their needs. Pet and shear them, play with them, and decorate their home. As your flock grows, so will their wishes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Build a beautiful home\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075740/extras/01de17ec3e9570bfed9593eef6cd6181.webp?t=1786225826\" width=\"600\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075740/extras/76e70a1be6d83e67f5a2814c6ed9b970.poster.avif?t=1786225826\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075740/extras/76e70a1be6d83e67f5a2814c6ed9b970.webm?t=1786225826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075740/extras/76e70a1be6d83e67f5a2814c6ed9b970.mp4?t=1786225826\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautify your ranch with a wide range of decorations and customization options. A fireplace to chase away the evening chill, cooling shade during the day, or beautiful flowers to brighten the meadows. Upgrade and improve buildings to automate manual work and support your growing flock. Your sheep will surely be thankful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Relax in serene nature\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075740/extras/9815a3486c0797d874cf95fc6acdf7c7.webp?t=1786225826\" width=\"600\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075740/extras/591f6c1af70b45ea44a026a76d8b1e52.poster.avif?t=1786225826\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075740/extras/591f6c1af70b45ea44a026a76d8b1e52.webm?t=1786225826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075740/extras/591f6c1af70b45ea44a026a76d8b1e52.mp4?t=1786225826\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of the day, kick back and relax in the beautiful countryside. Enjoy the fruits of your labor as you watch your sheep graze in lush green meadows while the sun sets over the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sheep Farming 101</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Care for your flock \u2013 Pet, play with, and meet the needs of your sheep to keep them happy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your ranch \u2013 Upgrade buildings and automate work to grow your ranch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make a beautiful home \u2013 Choose from a wide range of decorations and customization options to personalize your home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax and unwind \u2013 Enjoy your hard work as your home flourishes, all set against a picturesque Mediterranean landscape</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Tend to a flock of sheep and build your perfect Mediterranean farm in this cozy ranch-builder! Decorate, expand, and create the perfect home for your fluffy friends. Yes, you can cuddle them.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075740/3e6cfcebbee9e31d4e1199b09064d2130bf9a17f/header.jpg?t=1786225826", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Cozy", "Relaxing", "Base Building", "Nature", "Management", "Sandbox"], "developers": "Redknot Games", "publishers": "Redknot Games", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4075740", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "6 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/q0zBJH91d7E", "first_seen": 1785967200.0, "review_rank": 173}